{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-20","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：最小公倍数与比例与整数","englishTitle":"The least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less.","book":7,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","contentId":"euclid-7-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"69c1945ba53a47b8c2fa4c50eadb8fd8fb7208ffa15dc9ffed30fb3dabd3544c","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-20.statement","euclid-7-20.construction.1","euclid-7-20.proof.1","euclid-7-20.proof.2","euclid-7-20.proof.3","euclid-7-20.construction.2","euclid-7-20.proof.4","euclid-7-20.proof.5","euclid-7-20.proof.6","euclid-7-20.proof.7","euclid-7-20.proof.8","euclid-7-20.conclusion","euclid-7-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa1793181dbe291994d95e8e181b4dd6b4efe1654d00f6fb326b1fa635dc878a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the greater the greater and the less the less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与整除比相同的人数最少,但数目相同,数量较多,数量较少,数量较少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77577304ac81c848a4e8702ed9f6f156c9aead42a42049d815eef704b8ea233a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let CD, EF be the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with A, B; I say that CD measures A the same number of times that EF measures B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设 CD、EF 是与 A、B 具有相同比例的一对最小整数。要证明：CD 整除 A 的倍数，等于 EF 整除 B 的倍数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9fcbc16d7e5f6130bd3393316ec714b2a32cc805318755c18514aa3df90e2d7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now CD is not parts of A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在CD不是A的一部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be018850683f7d1c8650a4f252ca5bf7036c08cfee098ee66583ee17a4605e31","citations":["euclid-7-13","euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so; therefore EF is also the same parts of B that CD is of A. [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13) and [Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,就让它去;因此,EF也是B的CD的A。 [ [VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13) [Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"955ad6f968e1146605c9f40ed04874cd46f8ff8301f0133708c18836e4c4140d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as many parts of A as there are in CD, so many parts of B are there also in EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A中与CD一样多的部分B的很多地方 在EF也存在"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"861032075d0619876582f7d82eeed4f77de657561e0881891c88e62734049c8c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CD be divided into the parts of A, namely CG, GD, and EF into the parts of B, namely EH, HF; thus the multitude of CG, GD will be equal to the multitude of EH, HF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让CD分为A,即CG、GD和EF,即B,即EH、HF;因此,CG、GD将相当于EH、HF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8bec5f937c8bde3bb657c09f975be79d3b4e9b2743eade235818c24f34b5a19d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the numbers CG, GD are equal to one another, and the numbers EH, HF are also equal to one another, while the multitude of CG, GD is equal to the multitude of EH, HF, therefore, as CG is to EH, so is GD to HF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于CG,GD是相互等同的,EH,HF也是相互等同的,而CG,GD是EH,HF是EH,HF,CG与EH,CG和HF的比例是等同的；CG 与 EH 之比等于 GD 与 HF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c692860b4a5c15e90166636f10df0520192f599f174a61efddaf5fa1843f1d45","citations":["euclid-7-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so will all the antecedents be to all the consequents. [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,前功过簿之一,后功过簿之一,前功过簿也各尽其责。 [[VII. 12](/principles/euclid-7-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a08e41d1d5e6ed99bac98779a8ee24d28bf2b6d444e785079ff01953aaa6cd07","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as CG is to EH, so is CD to EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CG比EH等于CD比EF；CG 与 EH 之比等于 CD 与 EF 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5d1354b10999c8d9b818594c1d2f814415ae13a963955310f7a850164f28cf8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CG, EH are in the same ratio with CD, EF, being less than they: which is impossible, for by hypothesis CD, EF are the least numbers of those which have the same ratio with them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CG,EH与CD,EF处于相同比例,低于CD,EF,这是不可能的:根据假设,CD,EF与它们具有相同比例的人中人数最少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"731917d97832031ba70c92b2080e50549f62220c63b28dc7194aa21777005324","citations":["euclid-7-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore CD is not parts of A; therefore it is a part of it. [[VII. 4](/principles/euclid-7-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CD项不是A项的一部分,因此是其中的一部分。 [[VII. 4](/principles/euclid-7-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"caccc114266204d40b916d60d2f5e8fc6aa0a16d59c3c71d93cbe6f5486f3d1e","citations":["euclid-7-13","euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF is the same part of B that CD is of A; [[VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13) and [Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)] therefore CD measures A the same number of times that EF measures B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF是B的同一部分 CD是A,CD是A,CD 整除 A是EF,EF的相同倍数 EF 整除 B. 证毕。 [ [VII. 13](/principles/euclid-7-13) [Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-20.source","contentId":"euclid-7-20","revisionId":"euclid-7-20@raw-69c1945ba53a47b8","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6a9ab07a15f9b6be19b83ae43cb18236e53258c009713123510109960a14f6b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"g